\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Responsibility confounding and earning roles. (a) Both cases receive a revise judgment. The original producer artifact is bound to $B$ at version $v0$; its independent contract check $Q$ and the recipient's use trace support producer-attributable evidence $e$. Consumer-only changes remain an attribution-audit case. (b) At a legal read cut, public evidence informs a local choice that is sealed before target execution. After the checks in Figure\nonbreakingspace \ref {fig:method-state}, delayed selected-only feedback changes a future state. File changes, the sampled peer, and state highlights are schematic.}}{3}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
